{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果新發佈的iPhone Duo採用側邊Touch ID指紋識別方案，取代了近年來iPhone產品線普遍使用的Face ID面部識別。然而，多家媒體和知名評測人士在最新體驗報告中指出，雖然Touch ID能夠完成基本解鎖任務，但在實際使用中帶來了明顯摩擦感，不少人認為這是該設備最大的妥協之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583282.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.065069+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:42:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"3c4b2fcf95c30710c113f7906dbf337b44556f3c584bed54d22cc5a5f5632fde","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}